@startuml configuration-lifecycle
!include _theme.iuml

[*] --> Unloaded
Unloaded --> Loading : command or API call supplies path
Loading --> Invalid : parse, import, owner or type error
Loading --> Normalized : composition and validation succeed
Invalid --> [*] : report ConfigError
Normalized --> Resolving : repository selected
Resolving --> InventoryOnly : excluded, archived or manage false
Resolving --> Effective : applicable policy resolved
InventoryOnly --> [*] : audit visibility or no mutation
Effective --> Observing : request policy-relevant GitHub state
Observing --> Planned : readable or explicitly unreadable evidence captured
Observing --> Failed : unhandled discovery or API failure
Planned --> [*] : changes returned
Failed --> [*] : command reports failure
@enduml
